{"seq":4,"slug":"script-setup","title":"script setup 语法糖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/composition-api/script-setup","wordCount":535,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"script-setup-语法糖\">script setup 语法糖</h1><h2 id=\"编译器宏概述\">编译器宏概述</h2><p><code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 是 Vue 3.2 引入的编译时语法糖，它将整个 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 块编译为组件的 <code>setup()</code> 函数。在其中可以使用一系列<strong>编译器宏</strong>（compiler macros），这些宏无需导入、在编译时被处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Source[&quot;源代码&quot;]&#10;        SS[&quot;&amp;lt;script setup&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Compiler[&quot;Vue 编译器&quot;]&#10;        P[&quot;解析宏&quot;]&#10;        T[&quot;生成 setup 函数&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Output[&quot;编译产物&quot;]&#10;        SF[&quot;setup() { ... }&quot;]&#10;        DP[&quot;props 定义&quot;]&#10;        DE[&quot;emits 定义&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Source --&gt; Compiler --&gt; Output\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Source[\"源代码\"]\n        SS[\"&amp;lt;script setup&amp;gt;\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Compiler[\"Vue 编译器\"]\n        P[\"解析宏\"]\n        T[\"生成 setup 函数\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Output[\"编译产物\"]\n        SF[\"setup() { ... }\"]\n        DP[\"props 定义\"]\n        DE[\"emits 定义\"]\n    end\n    Source --&gt; Compiler --&gt; Output</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>宏</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>defineProps</code></td>\n<td>声明 props</td>\n<td>3.2+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>defineEmits</code></td>\n<td>声明事件</td>\n<td>3.2+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>defineExpose</code></td>\n<td>暴露公共方法</td>\n<td>3.2+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>defineOptions</code></td>\n<td>组件选项</td>\n<td>3.3+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>defineSlots</code></td>\n<td>类型化插槽</td>\n<td>3.3+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>defineModel</code></td>\n<td>双向绑定</td>\n<td>3.4+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>withDefaults</code></td>\n<td>props 默认值</td>\n<td>3.2+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>编译器宏</strong>：只在编译期展开的特殊函数，无需导入、不进入运行时产物，因此不能当作普通函数传递。</li>\n<li><strong>顶层绑定暴露</strong>：<code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 中的顶层变量、函数、导入的组件自动对模板可见，无需显式 <code>return</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>组件契约</strong>：<code>defineProps</code> / <code>defineEmits</code> / <code>defineSlots</code> 分别声明组件的输入、输出与插槽形状，是编译期类型与运行时校验的共同来源。</li>\n<li><strong>公共 API 边界</strong>：<code>defineExpose</code> 决定父组件通过模板 <code>ref</code> 能触达哪些成员，默认不暴露任何内容。</li>\n<li><strong>异步组件</strong>：顶层 <code>await</code> 会把组件变为异步组件，必须由 <code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 包裹。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"defineprops\">defineProps</h2><h3 id=\"运行时声明\">运行时声明</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const props = defineProps({&#10;  title: { type: String, required: true },&#10;  count: { type: Number, default: 0 },&#10;  items: { type: Array as () =&gt; string[], default: () =&gt; [] },&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const props = defineProps({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: { type: String, required: true },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count: { type: Number, default: 0 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items: { type: Array as () => string[], default: () => [] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"类型声明-推荐\">类型声明（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;interface Props {&#10;  title: string&#10;  count?: number&#10;  items?: string[]&#10;  onUpdate?: (value: string) =&gt; void&#10;}&#10;&#10;const props = defineProps&lt;Props&gt;()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Props {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count?: number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items?: string[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onUpdate?: (value: string) => void</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const props = defineProps&#x3C;Props>()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"withdefaults\">withDefaults</h3><p>类型声明模式下使用 <code>withDefaults</code> 提供默认值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;interface Props {&#10;  title: string;&#10;  count?: number;&#10;  items?: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const props = withDefaults(defineProps&lt;Props&gt;(), {&#10;  count: 0,&#10;  items: () =&gt; [],&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Props {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count?: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items?: string[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const props = withDefaults(defineProps&#x3C;Props>(), {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count: 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items: () => [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"解构-props-3-3\">解构 props（3.3+）</h3><p>Vue 3.3+ 支持直接解构 <code>defineProps</code> 的返回值，编译器自动保持响应性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const { title, count = 0 } = defineProps&lt;{&#10;  title: string;&#10;  count?: number;&#10;}&gt;();&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;h1&gt;{{ title }}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;  &lt;span&gt;{{ count }}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { title, count = 0 } = defineProps&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count?: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;h1>{{ title }}&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;span>{{ count }}&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"defineemits\">defineEmits</h2><h3 id=\"类型声明\">类型声明</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const emit = defineEmits&lt;{&#10;  (e: &#39;change&#39;, value: string): void;&#10;  (e: &#39;update:modelValue&#39;, value: number): void;&#10;  (e: &#39;submit&#39;): void;&#10;}&gt;();&#10;&#10;// 3.3+ 简写语法&#10;const emit = defineEmits&lt;{&#10;  change: [value: string];&#10;  &#39;update:modelValue&#39;: [value: number];&#10;  submit: [];&#10;}&gt;();&#10;&#10;function handleClick() {&#10;  emit(&#39;change&#39;, &#39;new-value&#39;);&#10;  emit(&#39;submit&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const emit = defineEmits&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (e: 'change', value: string): void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (e: 'update:modelValue', value: number): void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (e: 'submit'): void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3.3+ 简写语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const emit = defineEmits&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  change: [value: string];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  'update:modelValue': [value: number];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  submit: [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function handleClick() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  emit('change', 'new-value');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  emit('submit');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"defineexpose\">defineExpose</h2><p>默认情况下，<code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 组件不会暴露任何内容给父组件的 <code>ref</code>。使用 <code>defineExpose</code> 显式暴露：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 子组件 ChildForm.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const formData = ref({ name: &#39;&#39;, email: &#39;&#39; });&#10;&#10;function validate(): boolean {&#10;  return formData.value.name.length &gt; 0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function reset() {&#10;  formData.value = { name: &#39;&#39;, email: &#39;&#39; };&#10;}&#10;&#10;defineExpose({ validate, reset });&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 子组件 ChildForm.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const formData = ref({ name: '', email: '' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function validate(): boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return formData.value.name.length > 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function reset() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  formData.value = { name: '', email: '' };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineExpose({ validate, reset });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 父组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;import ChildForm from &#39;./ChildForm.vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const formRef = ref&lt;InstanceType&lt;typeof ChildForm&gt; | null&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;function handleSubmit() {&#10;  if (formRef.value?.validate()) {&#10;    console.log(&#39;表单验证通过&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;ChildForm ref=&quot;formRef&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;button @click=&quot;handleSubmit&quot;&gt;提交&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 父组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import ChildForm from './ChildForm.vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const formRef = ref&#x3C;InstanceType&#x3C;typeof ChildForm> | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function handleSubmit() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (formRef.value?.validate()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    console.log('表单验证通过');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;ChildForm ref=\"formRef\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;button @click=\"handleSubmit\">提交&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"definemodel-3-4\">defineModel（3.4+）</h2><p><code>defineModel</code> 简化了 <code>v-model</code> 的实现，无需手动声明 prop 和 emit：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 之前的写法 --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const props = defineProps&lt;{ modelValue: string }&gt;();&#10;const emit = defineEmits&lt;{ &#39;update:modelValue&#39;: [value: string] }&gt;();&#10;&#10;function updateValue(val: string) {&#10;  emit(&#39;update:modelValue&#39;, val);&#10;}&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 使用 defineModel --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const model = defineModel&lt;string&gt;({ required: true });&#10;&#10;// model 是一个 ref，可直接读写&#10;// 写入时自动触发 update:modelValue 事件&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;input v-model=&quot;model&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 之前的写法 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const props = defineProps&#x3C;{ modelValue: string }>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const emit = defineEmits&#x3C;{ 'update:modelValue': [value: string] }>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function updateValue(val: string) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  emit('update:modelValue', val);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 使用 defineModel --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const model = defineModel&#x3C;string>({ required: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// model 是一个 ref，可直接读写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 写入时自动触发 update:modelValue 事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;input v-model=\"model\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><p>多个 <code>v-model</code> 绑定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;const firstName = defineModel&lt;string&gt;(&#39;firstName&#39;, { required: true });&#10;const lastName = defineModel&lt;string&gt;(&#39;lastName&#39;, { required: true });&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;input v-model=&quot;firstName&quot; placeholder=&quot;名&quot; /&gt;&#10;  &lt;input v-model=&quot;lastName&quot; placeholder=&quot;姓&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const firstName = defineModel&#x3C;string>('firstName', { required: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const lastName = defineModel&#x3C;string>('lastName', { required: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;input v-model=\"firstName\" placeholder=\"名\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;input v-model=\"lastName\" placeholder=\"姓\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"顶层-await\">顶层 await</h2><p><code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 支持顶层 <code>await</code>，组件会自动成为异步组件，需配合 <code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;interface Post {&#10;  id: number;&#10;  title: string;&#10;  body: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const response = await fetch(&#39;/api/posts/1&#39;);&#10;const post: Post = await response.json();&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;article&gt;&#10;    &lt;h1&gt;{{ post.title }}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;{{ post.body }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;  &lt;/article&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Post {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const response = await fetch('/api/posts/1');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const post: Post = await response.json();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;article></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;h1>{{ post.title }}&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;p>{{ post.body }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/article></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;父组件&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Suspense&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; |&quot;#default&quot;| C[&quot;异步组件(顶层 await)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; |&quot;#fallback&quot;| D[&quot;加载中...&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; |await 完成| E[&quot;渲染内容&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"父组件\"] --&gt; B[\"Suspense\"]\n    B --&gt; |\"#default\"| C[\"异步组件(顶层 await)\"]\n    B --&gt; |\"#fallback\"| D[\"加载中...\"]\n    C --&gt; |await 完成| E[\"渲染内容\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"泛型组件-3-3\">泛型组件（3.3+）</h2><p>使用 <code>generic</code> 属性定义泛型组件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot; generic=&quot;T extends { id: number }&quot;&gt;&#10;interface Props {&#10;  items: T[];&#10;  selected?: T;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const props = defineProps&lt;Props&gt;();&#10;const emit = defineEmits&lt;{&#10;  select: [item: T];&#10;}&gt;();&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;ul&gt;&#10;    &lt;li v-for=&quot;item in items&quot; :key=&quot;item.id&quot; @click=&quot;emit(&#39;select&#39;, item)&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;slot :item=&quot;item&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/li&gt;&#10;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\" generic=\"T extends { id: number }\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Props {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  items: T[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  selected?: T;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const props = defineProps&#x3C;Props>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const emit = defineEmits&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  select: [item: T];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;li v-for=\"item in items\" :key=\"item.id\" @click=\"emit('select', item)\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;slot :item=\"item\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>&lt;script setup&gt;</code> 是编译时语法糖，顶层绑定自动暴露给模板</li>\n<li><code>defineProps</code> 推荐使用类型声明模式，配合 <code>withDefaults</code> 设置默认值</li>\n<li><code>defineEmits</code> 支持 3.3+ 简写语法，类型更直观</li>\n<li><code>defineExpose</code> 控制组件公共 API，仅暴露必要的方法和属性</li>\n<li><code>defineModel</code>（3.4+）大幅简化 <code>v-model</code> 实现</li>\n<li>顶层 <code>await</code> 使组件自动变为异步组件，需 <code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> 包裹</li>\n<li>泛型组件（3.3+）通过 <code>generic</code> 属性实现类型参数化</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"script setup 语法糖","id":"script-setup-语法糖"},{"level":2,"text":"编译器宏概述","id":"编译器宏概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"defineProps","id":"defineprops"},{"level":3,"text":"运行时声明","id":"运行时声明"},{"level":3,"text":"类型声明（推荐）","id":"类型声明-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"withDefaults","id":"withdefaults"},{"level":3,"text":"解构 props（3.3+）","id":"解构-props-3-3"},{"level":2,"text":"defineEmits","id":"defineemits"},{"level":3,"text":"类型声明","id":"类型声明"},{"level":2,"text":"defineExpose","id":"defineexpose"},{"level":2,"text":"defineModel（3.4+）","id":"definemodel-3-4"},{"level":2,"text":"顶层 await","id":"顶层-await"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型组件（3.3+）","id":"泛型组件-3-3"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"provide/inject 依赖注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/composition-api/provide-inject"},"next":{"title":"Props 与事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/props-and-events"}}